only update the sorc/smartinit.fd directory:
svn checkout https://svnemc.ncep.noaa.gov/projects/smartinit/tags/Build-3.3.1/sorc/smartinit.fd

Implementation instructions
1.  Create the updated executable "smartinit"
cd sorc/smartinit.fd
make

The make command will updated the smartinit executable in the 
../../exec directory.





